{
  "description": "Change of use of land and the existing kiosk building to a sauna and wellness facility (current use is Sui Generis). The proposal includes installation of a single timber-clad sauna cabin (approx. 6.15m x 2.8m), two cold plunge baths, outdoor showers, and a seating area with smokeless firepit, tension fabric awning and planting troughs; installation of Corten steel boundary fence panels; and internal and external alterations to the existing kiosk to provide changing rooms, showers, WC, lockers, a kitchen, plant room, and a food and drink serving hatch with awning.",
